    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one thing though, im a bit worried about stuff i cant see... like if something is happening deep inside the rumen or under the skin that i might miss at first. how do i tell if there's something \"lurking\" or hidden in there causing trouble before it's too late?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
