    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that. it just seems like so much could be going on where i cant see it. sometimes it feels like there's just these little unseen things causing havoc behind the scenes. whats the best way to stay on top of those hidden little troublemakers so they dont take over the whole recovery?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
